The HQ wants to receive telemetry from multiple on-board devices.

Open data telemetry on lines 3 through 6.

You can do it sequentially:
    03
    OBUS
    04
    OBUS
    05
    OBUS
    ...

But the most efficient way to do that is a loop with JNZ instruction.



-----------------------------------------------------------------------
-- the initial data line to start
-- we're going to move down from here
06
-- enable the current dataline
DUP
OBUS
-- loop over
01
SUB
DUP
02
SUB
01
JNZ
